<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PIXAR started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PIXAR started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said it initiated coverage of PIXAR as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said set a 12-18 month target of $20-$25 and said the stock &quot;has little risk at this level.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said PIXAR is the leading digital animation studio and appears destined to become a major force in the industry.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;this is a very attractive entry point to buy PIXAR shares before investors anticipate its next film.&quot;</p>
<p>-- PIXAR gained 3/8 to 15.</p>
</text>
